{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50682","headline":"江南杂题三十首 其十一 · 张祜","name":"江南杂题三十首 其十一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"碧草分遥岸，清池入细流。\n投铺虚饮马，自物且垂鈎。\n小鸟闻批颊，徵虫弄印头。\n（「徵」，严云：疑当作「徵」。\n《海录碎事》卷二十二引此二句，正作「微」字。\n）何妨一壶酒，远远棹扁舟。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张祜","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_50682.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50682","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}